      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate and dedicated clinic staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently praise the veterinarians and technicians for their helpfulness, warmth, and supportive attitude during routine checkups and surgical procedures. Reviewers appreciate that the team treats nervous pets with genuine affection. A couple of visitors reported long delays or unfriendly front desk interactions, but most describe a reassuring environment."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Affordable rates for pet care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize substantial financial savings on spay and neuter surgeries, preventive vaccinations, and microchipping compared to private clinics. Many pet owners note that the transparent, subsidised rates allow them to care for multiple rescue animals without excessive costs. Clients value the clinic's mission to keep veterinary services accessible."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive handling of companion animals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently note how gently dogs and cats are treated by clinical staff throughout appointments. Multiple reviewers mention that veterinary technicians take time to comfort anxious puppies and rescue animals before administering shots. Clients feel confident leaving their companions for routine surgeries and post-operative recovery."
      }
    }
  ],
